<title>ITALY: Cariplo 1996 cons net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Cariplo 1996 cons net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Consolidated net profit   123   vs    326</p>
<p>    Cons gross profit	    99   vs    810</p>
<p>    Total deposits	  163,336   (up 8.8 pct)</p>
<p>    Total loans	     174,176   (up 8.6 pct)</p>
<p>    Client loans	    104,501   (up 4.2 pct)</p>
<p>    Gross operating result  2,498   vs  2,512</p>
<p>    Net interest income     4,759   (down 1.9 pct)</p>
<p>    Total operating income  6,953   (up 4.9 pct)</p>
<p>    Group net equity	 10,199</p>
<p>Note - Savings bank Cassa di Risparmio Delle Provincie Lombarde (Cariplo) said costs had risen 8.3 percent and it made adjustments and provisions for 2.51 trillion lire.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
